{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:722","content":{"id":722,"title":"最长连续序列","content":[{"children":[{"text":"题目描述","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"61622e90-e07b-4bbf-879a-e1baff3fc9a4","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"给定一个未排序的整数数组 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"nums","type":"formatted"},{"text":" ，找出数字连续的最长序列（不要求序列元素在原数组中连续）的长度。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e3ceb483-bf9f-4cd0-8863-838ee59ac71c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"请你设计并实现时间复杂度为 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"O(n)","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b883a9ff-7577-4b67-b241-97191d10f17f","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"O(n)","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 的算法解决此问题。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"772e5ac3-d0dc-48b3-aa86-35f120ec28e2","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"输入：","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"nums = [100,4,200,1,3,2]","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d7edc880-e898-450c-b414-9fcac38299c9","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"输出：","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"4","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c836db0e-30cd-4cd3-82b8-8e072a24a9ac","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"解释：最长数字连续序列是 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"[1, 2, 3, 4]","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。它的长度为 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"4","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6fb05d6e-a7c1-4ccc-94e2-5b49a9227752","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"a0597dfa-e83e-4a5e-b13e-08432ac0f780","open":true,"tauContract":"6f651c7baafe7521ca6995109244b4d914c31407a4c181a83538b42acd722b1e","title":"示例1","type":"detail"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"输入：","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"nums = [0,3,7,2,5,8,4,6,0,1]","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"06bb222b-111e-4884-bd8d-c898b97fbed1","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"输出：","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"9","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"badd5d09-cfdf-4bfd-a540-059f3bafc174","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"3e245075-0ed8-4923-83cc-f8a03a948cd3","open":true,"tauContract":"6f651c7baafe7521ca6995109244b4d914c31407a4c181a83538b42acd722b1e","title":"示例2","type":"detail"},{"children":[{"text":"提示：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"949252c2-90e7-45b7-ab40-be8d5aad7e9e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"0 <= nums.length <= 10^5","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"227ef2ba-1323-4a70-8737-7b85968146c2","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"b04ee568-bad7-41c9-8ce7-7ca7261b94f6","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"-10^9 <= nums[i] <= 10^9","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"036daafe-a5ab-4cd4-928a-1cceaaf880ff","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"136964fe-4bd9-43f2-93c8-98c52397f615","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"ac5ff248-d45c-418e-a33a-ae36b5d89155","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"解题思路","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0ab71fa2-0d2d-4d31-a8f3-15bb2b904cd8","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"该问题最最简单的做法就是遍历数组每一项时，再次遍历数组统计包含该项的最长序列是什么，但是问题是时间复杂度为 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"O(n^2)","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b7d0a68f-1eed-4c7a-a80d-832eea9be275","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"O(n^2)","type":"inline-math"},{"text":"﻿，不符合题目要求。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"13a03733-9214-4b59-99a2-f8fb592813b8","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"解决方案是使用一个哈希表先记录所有的数字，然后在遍历数组时查看 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"value - 1","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 是否存在，如果存在，则跳过，由 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"value - 1","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 去统计最长序列，如果不存在，则统计连续的序列。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7dbc496d-9e43-429f-92ab-4cc12746a653","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"function longestConsecutive(nums: number[]): number {\n    const set = new Set([...nums]);\n    let max = 0;\n    for (let value of set.values()) {\n        if (set.has(value - 1)) {\n            continue;\n        }\n        let seq = 0;\n        while (set.has(value++)) {\n            seq++;\n        }\n        max = Math.max(max, seq);\n    }\n\n    return max;\n};","collabId":"fd3b24aa-4314-4335-bbea-379fc38d8c35","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"489ff27e-5253-4e8c-88c5-f67cacd98187","language":"ts","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"d5079a95-45a8-467c-9f98-2dcc73b2a270"},{"children":[{"text":"参考","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"aa566fad-b0f7-4494-adc3-b6b489314308","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"最长连续序列","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"98bea394-951a-485b-aea4-cbd03775f94d","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","type":"link","url":"https://leetcode.cn/problems/longest-consecutive-sequence/description/?envType=study-plan-v2&envId=top-interview-150"}],"collabId":"462f6826-f47e-4ec0-9fa8-351d26163c13","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"3fa45cc1-20e0-43ba-9f73-b95057697ba5","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"e9671768-6117-4be9-b6d6-d442e68ff872","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"哈希表"},{"label":"最长连续序列","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:722","type":"doc","id":722}}],"prevPage":{"title":"字母异位词分组","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:707","type":"doc","id":707}},"nextPage":{"title":"交错的字符串","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:685","type":"doc","id":685}},"createTime":1730036375139,"updateTime":1793532544985,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1793532544985}}